#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1320 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "THE --STRESC ALL-FACET GATE (Fix #331, M2-D24 bucket 2). LB declares no LBSTRESC column. Requirements.Variables.All gained the wildcard entry `--STRESC`; ScopeMatcher resolves it to LBSTRESC (EC-36), finds it absent and the rule is SKIPPED naming it. Drop the entry and the rule EXECUTES: under Fix #330 empty(--STRESC) is TRUE on every row of the absent column and every other conjunct is absence-tolerant here, so it would fire on every row -- the flood the gate exists for. If this EXECUTES, the gate was removed -- escalate."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB class=FINDINGS label="Laboratory Test Results"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col LBSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col LBTESTCD type=Char label="Lab Test or Examination Short Name"
col LBORRES  type=Char label="Result or Finding in Original Units"
col LBSTAT   type=Char label="Completion Status"
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | ALB |  |
S1 | LB | 001 | 2 | ALT | 12 |
---
